### `[static]` bool QDir::setCurrent(const [QString](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstring.html) \&*path*)

Sets the application's current working directory to *path*. Returns `true` if the
directory was successfully changed; otherwise returns `false`.

```
QString absolute = "/local/bin";
QString relative = "local/bin";
QFileInfo absFile(absolute);
QFileInfo relFile(relative);

QDir::setCurrent(QDir::rootPath());
